<title>USA: Wall Street stocks higher at start.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks higher at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street  moved higher at the start on Friday, bouncing slightly from yesterday's weakness and drawing some strength from the April jobs report.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were up seven at 6984 and the Nasdaq Composite was up five at 1276.</p>
